#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:1
msgid "Quantize weights"
msgstr "量化权重"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:3
msgid ""
"Quantize selected checkpoint weights when you need W4A16, W8A16, W8A8, "
"GPTQ, AWQ, or AutoRound artifacts for inference-oriented testing."
msgstr "当你需要面向推理测试的 W4A16、W8A16、W8A8、GPTQ、AWQ 或 AutoRound 产物时，量化选定的检查点权重。"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:5
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前置条件"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:7
msgid "Before quantization, prepare:"
msgstr "量化之前，请准备："

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:9
msgid "a local HuggingFace `safetensors` input directory"
msgstr "本地 HuggingFace `safetensors` 输入目录"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:10
msgid "an empty output directory"
msgstr "空的输出目录"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:11
msgid "enough disk space for generated shards and metadata"
msgstr "用于生成分片和元数据的足够磁盘空间"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:12
msgid ""
"a selected quantization method, weight bit width, activation bit width, "
"and output ABI"
msgstr "选定的量化方法、权重位宽、激活位宽和输出 ABI"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:13
msgid ""
"calibration data if using GPTQ, AWQ, AutoRound, or any workflow that "
"requires calibration"
msgstr "如果使用 GPTQ、AWQ、AutoRound，或任何需要校准的工作流，请准备校准数据"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:15
msgid "Run `inspect` before choosing selectors:"
msgstr "选择器之前先运行 `inspect`："

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:21
msgid "Choose a quantization family"
msgstr "选择量化系列"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md
msgid "Family"
msgstr "系列"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md
msgid "Typical command options"
msgstr "典型命令选项"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md
msgid "Output purpose"
msgstr "输出用途"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md
msgid "MSE W4A16"
msgstr "MSE W4A16"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md
msgid ""
"`--method mse --bits 4 --activation-bits 16 --strategy group --group-size"
" 32`"
msgstr "`--method mse --bits 4 --activation-bits 16 --strategy group --group-size 32`"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md
msgid "maximum weight compression candidate"
msgstr "最大权重压缩候选方案"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md
msgid "MSE W8A16"
msgstr "MSE W8A16"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md
msgid ""
"`--method mse --bits 8 --activation-bits 16 --strategy group --group-size"
" 128`"
msgstr "`--method mse --bits 8 --activation-bits 16 --strategy group --group-size 128`"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md
msgid "conservative baseline"
msgstr "保守基线"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md
msgid "MSE W8A16 channel"
msgstr "MSE W8A16 通道模式"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md
msgid "`--method mse --bits 8 --activation-bits 16 --strategy channel`"
msgstr "`--method mse --bits 8 --activation-bits 16 --strategy channel`"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md
msgid "ordinary Linear or attention channel-weight test"
msgstr "普通 Linear 或注意力通道权重测试"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md
msgid "MSE W8A8"
msgstr "MSE W8A8"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md
msgid "`--method mse --bits 8 --activation-bits 8 --strategy channel`"
msgstr "`--method mse --bits 8 --activation-bits 8 --strategy channel`"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md
msgid "INT8 weight and dynamic per-token activation testing"
msgstr "INT8 权重和动态逐 token 激活测试"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md
msgid "GPTQ"
msgstr "GPTQ"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md
msgid "`--method gptq --format gptq` or inferred format"
msgstr "`--method gptq --format gptq` 或推断出的格式"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md
msgid "calibrated GPTQ-compatible export"
msgstr "兼容 GPTQ 的校准导出"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md
msgid "AWQ"
msgstr "AWQ"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md
msgid "`--method awq --format awq` or inferred format"
msgstr "`--method awq --format awq` 或推断出的格式"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md
msgid "calibrated AWQ-compatible export"
msgstr "兼容 AWQ 的校准导出"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md
msgid "AutoRound"
msgstr "AutoRound"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md
msgid "`--method autoround`"
msgstr "`--method autoround`"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md
msgid "calibrated AutoRound workflow"
msgstr "校准 AutoRound 工作流"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:34
msgid ""
"For W8A8, do not pass `--group-size`. Use `--bits 8 --activation-bits 8 "
"--strategy channel`."
msgstr "对于 W8A8，不要传入 `--group-size`。请使用 `--bits 8 --activation-bits 8 --strategy channel`。"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:37
msgid ""
"W8A16 channel is also a valid INT8 policy for ordinary Linear and "
"attention weights. Do not use it for routed MoE weights; use W8A16 group "
"or the complete W8A8 policy instead. Channel strategies never accept "
"`--group-size`."
msgstr "W8A16 通道模式也是普通 Linear 和注意力权重的有效 INT8 策略。不要将其用于路由 MoE 权重；请使用 W8A16 分组模式，或完整的 W8A8 策略。通道策略从不接受 `--group-size`。"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:39
msgid "Run a conservative W8A16 dry-run"
msgstr "运行保守的 W8A16 dry-run"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:41
msgid "Use W8A16 group quantization as the first baseline:"
msgstr "使用 W8A16 分组量化作为第一个基线："

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:57
msgid "Verify before generation:"
msgstr "生成之前请验证："

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:59
msgid "the selected weights match the intended layer groups"
msgstr "已选权重与预期层组匹配"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:60
msgid "no selector is unmatched"
msgstr "没有选择器未匹配"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:61
msgid "each selected layer satisfies the group-size constraint"
msgstr "每个已选层都满足组大小约束"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:62
msgid "fused pairs and routed expert banks are not split"
msgstr "没有拆分融合对和路由专家权重组"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:63
msgid ""
"the reported output format and quantization scheme match the intended "
"runtime"
msgstr "报告的输出格式和量化方案与目标运行时一致"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:65
msgid "Generate the W8A16 artifact"
msgstr "生成 W8A16 产物"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:67
msgid "Remove `--dry-run`:"
msgstr "移除 `--dry-run`："

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:82
msgid "Generate a W4A16 artifact"
msgstr "生成 W4A16 产物"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:84
msgid "Use W4A16 when you need a maximum compression candidate:"
msgstr "当你需要最大压缩候选方案时，使用 W4A16："

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:99
msgid ""
"Focus regression testing on accuracy-sensitive workloads before treating "
"a W4A16 artifact as deployable."
msgstr "在将 W4A16 产物视为可部署之前，应重点对准确率敏感的工作负载进行回归测试。"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:101
msgid "Generate a W8A8 artifact"
msgstr "生成 W8A8 产物"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:103
msgid ""
"Use W8A8 only when the target runtime supports dynamic per-token INT8 "
"activation handling:"
msgstr "仅当目标运行时支持动态逐 token INT8 激活处理时，才使用 W8A8："

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:117
msgid ""
"For fused routed-expert banks, W8A8 expands loader-facing tensors such as"
" `experts.<id>.<projection>.weight` and "
"`experts.<id>.<projection>.weight_scale`."
msgstr "对于融合的路由专家权重组，W8A8 会展开面向加载器的张量，例如 `experts.<id>.<projection>.weight` 和 `experts.<id>.<projection>.weight_scale`。"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:121
msgid ""
"Do not infer speedup from weight size alone. Runtime kernel support, "
"graph compilation, KV cache, and framework overhead affect actual memory "
"and throughput."
msgstr "不要仅根据权重大小推断加速比。运行时内核支持、图编译、KV cache 和框架开销都会影响实际内存占用和吞吐量。"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:123
msgid "Use a recipe"
msgstr "使用配方"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:125
msgid "Move stable quantization settings into YAML when you need reproducibility:"
msgstr "当你需要可复现性时，将稳定的量化设置移入 YAML："

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:135
msgid ""
"CLI values that are explicitly passed override recipe values. Selectors "
"from the CLI and recipe are merged."
msgstr "显式传入的 CLI 值会覆盖配方值。来自 CLI 和配方的选择器会合并。"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:137
msgid "Validate the output"
msgstr "验证输出"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:139
msgid "Validate every generated artifact:"
msgstr "验证每个生成的产物："

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:145
msgid "Expected result:"
msgstr "预期结果："

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:151
msgid "Fallbacks"
msgstr "回退方案"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:153
msgid "If quantization fails:"
msgstr "如果量化失败："

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:155
msgid "run `inspect` again and confirm selector names"
msgstr "再次运行 `inspect` 并确认选择器名称"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:156
msgid "rerun with `--dry-run` and a new empty output directory"
msgstr "使用 `--dry-run` 和新的空输出目录重新运行"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:157
msgid "reduce selection scope if one layer violates constraints"
msgstr "如果某一层违反约束，则缩小选择范围"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:158
msgid ""
"adjust `--group-size` only after checking selected layer shapes and "
"runtime support"
msgstr "只有检查已选层形状和运行时支持后，才调整 `--group-size`"

#: ../../source/how-to/quantize-weights.md:159
msgid ""
"use `--backend cpu` only as a fallback, not as proof that the target "
"accelerator runtime works"
msgstr "仅将 `--backend cpu` 作为回退方案，不要以此证明目标加速器运行时可用"

